{title: RAHA MBA FANTATRAO MANTSY}
{artist: EJEMA}
{key: MI}
{singers: Hasina}
{musicians: Haja=Clavier, Toky=Guitare}

raha mba fantatrao
mantsy malala
tebiteby isan'andro
mahazo ny akama e e
raha oviana ihany,
eny sa tsia ?
raha ny fitiavako anao
no aposako indray
mbola tsisy fiovany
vao maika mitombo ô ô ô
mila handrotra a a
sahirantsaina aho

ô ô ô cheri e,
aza ela fiavy
sasa-miandry avokoa
izaho sy ny fianakaviana
ô ô ô malala e,
vodivodiana
mitoe-drery mangina,
agnaty ao rô mila ho tsy tanty

{interlude}

Mahita anao fôna,
isan'andro isan'andro ô
Mahatsiaro anao,
ka latsa-talaho
Mihevera ra,
fa samy mpandalo ô
ô ô ô ambor'ategna rô

{interlude}

ô ô ô cheri e,
aza ela fiavy
sasa-miandry avokoa
izaho sy ny fianakaviana
ô ô ô malala e,
vodivodiana
mitoe-drery mangina,
agnaty ao rô mila ho tsy tanty

ô ô ô cheri e,
aza ela fiavy
sasa-miandry avokoa izaho
sy ny fianakaviana
ô ô ô malala e,
vodivodiana
mitoe-drery mangina,
